{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0f1897e9-68b7-8583-8b4e-1e8f10216949",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T11:12:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nelson Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:05:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. Um, I think I'm calling the right place? It's about a storm drain, sort of, a catch basin, on Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:05:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that would be us. Kay Street, okay. Do you have a house number or a nearby cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, so I manage the building at 56 Kay Street, up in the Historic Hill area. The basin is maybe right out front, I think, like almost in front of the walkway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:06:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 56 Kay Street, catch basin right out front. And what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:06:18-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's basically full of sand. I think it's from the winter road treatment, the sand and salt stuff they put down. It's packed in there, maybe up to the grate. And the water just sits. The street holds water for, I'd say, about a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About a week of standing water. Is that after it rains or snows, or has it been dry lately?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:06:48-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's the thing, it's dry. There's no storm. I think it's been dry for days, maybe more. It's just sitting there, sort of a puddle that spreads across the gutter and into the road. It doesn't drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:07:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, so no storm, just water that's not going down. And it's been sitting there a week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:07:15-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. And it keeps happening. I mean, I think it's been like this on and off since the sanding started. Sorry, hang on, I can hear my own voice echo on this phone, it's kind of distracting. Can you hear that too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:07:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do hear a little bit of an echo, yes. Is there a way you can switch off speaker, or move to a different spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:07:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me try. [pause] Okay, I think that's a little better. Maybe. Anyway, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:07:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble. You were saying it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:07:59-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So I went out and cleared the leaves off the grate by hand, because I thought maybe that was it. And it helped, sort of, for like ten minutes. The water went down a bit. Then it backed up again, because underneath it's just sand, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you pulled the leaves off the grate, it drained for about ten minutes, and then it stopped again because of the sand below."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:08:33-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. I mean, I think so. I can't see down in there really. I'm not going to start digging sand out of a city drain. That's not my job, and it's honestly, I don't know, maybe two weeks now I've been dealing with this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:08:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And have you called about this one before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think my office might have mentioned it, maybe? I'm not sure. But nobody has come out, as far as I know. Nobody I've seen, anyway. So I'm calling again, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I don't see anything I can pull up while we talk, so I'll put in a new request. The catch basins get cleaned out by a crew, so what I'll do is write it up as a clogged catch basin full of sand with standing water at 56 Kay Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:09:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is that who I should be calling to get it checked? Like is there a specific person or department? I just want to know who to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:09:51-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right department. Public Works handles the drains, and I'm entering it now so it goes to the crew that does the basin cleaning. If you want to follow up, you call this same line and give them the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:10:11-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because, I think, it's getting pretty frustrating. The water freezes at night too, sort of, so there's ice across the gutter by the sidewalk, and I'm worried somebody's going to slip. Well, not worried, I just, it's a hassle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:10:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's worth putting in the notes. Let me add that there's ice forming where the water sits. Can I get a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:10:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0173. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nelson Pacheco. P-A-C-H-E-C-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:10:52-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nelson Pacheco. So, to read it back: 56 Kay Street, in front of the building, catch basin packed with sand, water standing about a week in dry weather, you cleared leaves by hand and it only helped for ten minutes, and there's ice at night. Did I miss anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I think that's it. Maybe just that it's been happening on and off, not just once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, recurring. I'll add that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how long, do you think? Like roughly, before somebody looks at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:35-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Those requests usually get looked at within a week or so, depending on what else is ahead of it. Sanded streets in the winter mean a lot of basins are in the same shape."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sure. I mean, a week is what the puddle takes by itself, so, you know. I'd just like it actually done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. It's logged now, and if you don't see anyone by next Tuesday, call back and we'll check on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Alright, thanks, Lorraine. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Nelson. Take care of that ice, and have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:24-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
